{"uid":"thig3.3","title":"Another Uttamā","reference":"Therīgāthā 3.3","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["Of the seven awakening factors,","the path for attaining extinguishment,","I have developed them all,","just as the Buddha taught.","I attain the meditations on emptiness","and signlessness whenever I want.","I am the Buddha’s bosom daughter,","always delighting in extinguishment.","All sensual pleasures are cut off,","whether human or heavenly.","Transmigration through births is finished,","now there’ll be no more future lives."]}]}
